> data\processed\docs\case-law\courts\sc\sc-appeal-198-2012-bb5a73cf29.md:3:1 IN THE SUPREME COURT OF THE DEMOCRATIC 
SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA In the matter of an appeal after obtaining from the Supreme Court leave to appeal 
against the Judgment dated 03/08/2010 delivered by the High Court of the Sabaragamuwa Province in Appeal No: 
SP/HCCA/KAG/587/2008(F) DC Kegalle Case No: 23878 Vidanalage Dingiri Banda (Deceased), of Kurunegoda, Kotiyakumbura. 
Plaintiff Vithanalage Senathileke of Kurunegoda, Kotiyakumbura. Substituted Plaintiff S.C. Appeal No. 198/2012 Vs. 
SP/HCCA/KAG Case No. 587/2008(F) D.C. Kegalle Case No. 23878/P 1. Henaka Ralalage Punchi Banda alias Vijitha Bandara, 
Kurunegoda, Kotiyakumbura. 2. Henaka Ralalage Podi Appuhamy (Deceased), No. 29, Kurunegoda, Kotiyakumbura. 2A. Henaka 
Ralalage Wimalasiri Menike, No. D27, Kurunegoda, Kotiyakumbura. 2 3. V.P.C. Vitharana, No. D34, Kurunegoda, 
