of No. 62, Galgran Oya, Ragala. Defendant-Respondent-Respondents Before: Hon. Justice A.L. Shiran Gooneratne Hon. 
Justice Mahinda Samayawardhena Hon. Justice K. Priyantha Fernando Counsel: W. Dayaratne, P.C. with Ms. Ranjika 
